<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pandora Business Technology & Marketing</title>
    <%- include('partials/metaPixel', { pixelId: pixelId }) %>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .thank-you-container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        .thank-you-container h1 {
            color: #0F55DC;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .thank-you-container p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .thank-you-container a {
            background-color: #0F55DC;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .thank-you-container a:hover {
            background-color: #0c449f;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="thank-you-container">
        <h1>Merci !</h1>
        <p>Votre message a bien été envoyé. Nous vous contacterons dans les plus brefs délais.</p>
        <a href="/">Retour à l'accueil</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>